hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"981","[AI-translation] Salim, Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat kartay hain ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kisi Musalman ko, jis ke paas wasiyat karnay ke qaabil koi cheez ho, laiq nahi ke wo teen raatein guzaray magar us ki wasiyat us ke paas likhi hui hona chahiye. Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke main ne jab se ye hadees Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suni hai mujh par aik raat bhi aisi nahi guzri ke mere paas meri wasiyat na ho. (Muslim: 5/70). Baab: Teesre hissay ki wasiyat, is se zyada na ho."
"982","[AI-translation] Fateh-e-Iran Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hajjat-ul-Wida mein meri iyadat ki jis mein main aisay dard mein mubtala tha ke maut ke qareeb ho gaya tha. Main ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mujhe jaisa dard hai Aap jantay hain aur main maaldaar aadmi hun aur mera waris siwa aik beti ke aur koi nahi hai, kya main do tihai maal khairaat kar dun? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Nahi. Main ne arz kiya aadha maal khairaat kar dun? To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke nahi. Aik tihai khairaat kar aur aik tihai bhi bohat hai. Agar tu apne warison ko maaldaar chhor jaye to is se behtar hai ke tu unhein mohtaj chhor kar jaye ke wo logon ke saamnay haath phailatay phirein. Aur tu jo kuch Allah Taala ki razamandi ke liye kharch karay ga to us ka sawab tujhe milay ga yahan tak ke us luqmay ka bhi jo tu apni biwi ke munh mein daalay. Main ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kya main apne ashaab se peechay reh jaun ga? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke agar tu peechay rahay ga, yani zinda rahay ga, aur aisa amal karay ga jis se Allah Taala ki khushi manzoor ho, to tera darja barhay ga aur buland ho ga aur shayad tu zinda rahay, yahan tak ke tujh se baaz logon ko faida ho aur baaz logon ko nuqsan. Ae Allah! Mere ashaab ki hijrat poori kar de aur un ko un ki airiyon par mat pher lekin bechara Sa'd bin Khaula! Rawi ne kaha ke un ke liye Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne is liye ranj ka izhaar kiya ke wo Makka mein hi faut ho gaye thay. (Muslim: 5/71). (Ashfaitu se murad maut ke qareeb hona hai.)"
"983","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Kaash log aik tihai se kam kar ke chauthai ki wasiyat kiya karein, kyunke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tihai ki rukhsat farmayi aur farmaya ke tihai bhi bohat, zyada, hai. (Muslim: 5/73). Baab: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki Allah ki kitab par amal ki wasiyat."
"984","[AI-translation] Talha bin Musarrif kehtay hain ke main ne Abdullah bin Abu Aufa (raziyallahu anhu) se poocha ke kya Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne maal waghera ke baaray mein wasiyat ki thi? Unhon ne kaha ke nahi. Phir main ne kaha ke phir Musalmanon par kyun wasiyat farz hui? Ya un ko wasiyat ka hukm kyun hua? Unhon ne kaha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Allah Taala ki kitab par amal karnay ki wasiyat ki thi. (Muslim: 5/74)"
"985","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne na koi dirham o deenaar chhora na bakri ya oont aur na kisi maal ke liye wasiyat ki. (Muslim: 5/75). (Bishay se murad khilafat ka koi amr nahi, warna Aap ne bohat wasiyatein keen.)"
"986","[AI-translation] Aswad bin Yazid kehtay hain ke logon ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke paas zikr kiya ke Ali (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke wasi thay, to unhon ne kaha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ko kab wasi banaya? Main Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko apne seenay se lagaye baithi thi ya Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) meri god mein thay ke itnay mein Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tasht mangwaya phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) meri god mein gir paray aur mujhe khabar nahi hui ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) wafaat paa chukay hain phir Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ko kis waqt wasiyat ki? (Muslim: 5/75). Baab: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki mushrikon ko jazeera-e-Arab se nikalnay aur wafad ki khatir ki wasiyat. (Wasi se murad khalifa banana hai; hajr seenay se neechay ka hissa hai; inkhinasa se murad aaza ka dheela par jana hai.)"
"987","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Jubair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke Jumeraat ka din, kya hai Jumeraat ka din? Phir roye yahan tak ke un ke aansuon se kankariyan tar ho gayeen. Main ne kaha ke Ae Ibn Abbas! Jumeraat ke din se kya gharz hai? Unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par beemari ki shiddat hui to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke mere paas dawaat aur takhti lao ke main tumhein aik tehreer likh dun taake tum mere baad gumrah na ho jao. Ye sun kar log kaghaz qalam ke mutaliq jhagarnay lagay aur paighambar ke paas jhagra nahi chahiye tha. Kehnay lagay ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka kya haal hai? Kya Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bhi laghw saadir ho sakta hai? Phir samajh lo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se achi tarah se samajh lo. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke mere paas se hat jao ke main jis kaam mein masroof hun wo is se behtar hai jis mein tum mashghool ho, jhagray aur ikhtilaf mein. Main tum ko teen baaton ki wasiyat karta hun aik to ye ke mushrikon ko jazeera-e-Arab se nikaal dena. Doosri jo sifaratein aayein un ki khatir usi tarah karna jaisay main kiya karta tha, taake aur qaumein khush hon aur un ko Islam ki taraf raghbat ho. Aur teesri baat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne nahi kahi ya Sa'id ne kaha ke main bhool gaya. (Muslim: 5/75). Baab: Sadqay mein lautnay se mumaniat. (Ma shanuhu se murad kya haal hai; ahajara se murad behoshi mein bakna hai.)"
"988","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne aik umda ghora Allah ki raah mein diya aur jis ko diya tha us ne us ko tabah kar diya. Main samjha ke ye us ko ab sastay daamon baich daalay ga. Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us ko mat khareed aur apne sadqay ko mat pher. Is liye ke sadqay mein lautnay wala is tarah hai jaisay kutta jo qai kar ke phir us ko kha jata hai. (Muslim: 5/63). (Ateeq se murad umda hai; la tabtau se murad mana hai.)"
"989","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hiba ko lautanay wala is tarah hai jaisay kutta qai kar ke phir apni qai ko kha jata hai. (Muslim: 5/64-65)"
"990","[AI-translation] Numan bin Bashir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid (raziyallahu anhu) ne apna kuch maal mujhe hiba kiya. Meri maan Amra bint Rawaha (raziyallahu anha) boli ke main is par us waqt khush hun gi ke tu is maal ke hiba karnay par Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko gawah kar de. Mere walid Bashir (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas is maal par gawah bananay ke liye gaye to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne poocha ke kya tu ne apni sab aulad ko aisa hi maal diya hai? Unhon ne kaha nahi. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala se daro aur apni aulad mein insaaf karo. Phir mere walid wapas aaye aur wo hiba wapas liya. Hiba ka maani tohfa hai. (Muslim: 5/65-66)"
"991","[AI-translation] Numan bin Bashir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid (raziyallahu anhu) mujhe Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas utha kar le gaye aur kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Gawah rahiye ke main ne apne betay Numan ko falan falan cheez apne maal mein se hiba ki. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kya sab beton ko tu ne aisa hi diya hai jaisa Numan ko diya hai? Mere walid (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke nahi. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke phir tu mujh ko gawah na kar aur kisi ko kar le. Is ke baad farmaya ke kya tujhe ye baat achi lagti hai ke sab tere saath neki karnay mein barabar hon? Mere walid ne kaha ke haan, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke phir tu aisa mat kar, yani aik ko de aur baaqi ko na de. (Muslim: 5/66-67). Baab: Us mard ke baaray mein jo kisi ko umra de. (Maqsood hadees ke lafz se tark hai, ghair ko gawah banana jaaiz nahi.)"
"992","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kisi ko us ki zindagi tak aur us ke wursa ko koi cheez hiba karay aur yun kahay ke ye main ne tujhe diya aur tere baad tere warison ko jab tak un mein se koi baaqi rahay, to wo usi ka ho ga jis ko umra diya gaya. Aur denay walay ko wapas na milay gi is liye ke us ne aisa atiya diya hai jis mein miraas ho gi. (Muslim: 5/67-68)"
"993","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apne maalon ko rokay rakho aur un ko mat bigaaro kyunke jo koi umra de wo usi ka ho ga jis ko diya jaye, wo zinda ho ya murda aur us ke marnay ke baad us ke warison ka hai. (Muslim: 5/68)"
